{"id":"excelente","lemma":"excelente","pos":"adj","rank":770,"glosses":["excellent, brilliant, superb","copacetic (US slang)","tiptop, topnotch, top notch"],"ipa":"/eɡsθeˈlente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"excelentes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-excelente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es un vino excelente.","en":"It's an excellent wine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34642"},{"text":"Los cerdos hormigueros son excelentes excavadores.","en":"Aardvarks are excellent diggers."},{"text":"Es una idea excelente.","en":"That's a terrific idea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630645"},{"text":"Tus resultados del examen son excelentes.","en":"Your examination results are excellent."},{"text":"Tenemos un cocinero excelente.","en":"We have a very good chef.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611770"}]}